CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/p com/corrodinggames/rts/game/TeamTagCount
	COMMENT TeamTagCount - the per-CustomTag counters kept by TeamUnitCaches: tag (the CustomTag), builtCount (finished units with the tag), inProgressCount (units under construction with the tag), queuedCount (tagged units sitting in factory build queues) and a short field e. [field names verified from the update logic in TeamUnitCaches]
	FIELD a tag Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/g;
	FIELD b builtCount I
	FIELD c inProgressCount I
	FIELD d queuedCount I
